# macOS Finder metadata. This repo is worked on from a Mac that also syncs
# Google Drive vaults, where .DS_Store is everywhere — one `git add -A` in a
# directory Finder has visited is all it takes.
#
# It is not only untidiness: `scripts/check-skill-roster.mjs` fails a directory
# under skills/ that holds files but no SKILL.md, and a lone .DS_Store counts as
# holding files. A committed one would turn an empty skill folder into a red CI
# job about a file the author cannot see in Finder. Cheaper to never take it.
.DS_Store
._*

# Editor and OS noise
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Node, for the guards' local runs
node_modules/
